  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "器官水分的损失，却正是与水汽离饱和的程度有关. 因此需",
        "要引入一个指示在一定温度下水汽离饱和程度的量——相对",
        "湿度."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**一定温度下空气中水汽压 $p$ 与该温度时饱和水汽压 $p_0$",
        "的比值，叫做空气的相对湿度 $\\gamma$，用百分数表示为**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\gamma=\\frac{p}{p_0}\\cdot100\\%.$　$(4-4)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**露点**　在一定压强下，降",
        "低未饱和汽的温度，迟早会使",
        "它转变为饱和汽. 如果看一看",
        "饱和水汽压与温度的关系图线",
        "（图 $63$），可以证实这一点."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设在温度 $t_1$ 时水汽压等"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 63",
      "box": [
        719,
        685,
        529,
        351
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-63"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 63",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 63"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于 $p_1$. 此时用点 $A$ 表示蒸汽的状态. 在压强 $p_1=$ 常量的情",
        "况下，温度降低到 $t_p$ 时蒸汽转变为饱和汽，用点 $B$ 表示它的",
        "状态. **水汽转变为饱和汽时的温度叫做露点.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当空气的温度降到露点时，水汽开始凝结：出现了雾、",
        "露水."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "露点可以表征空气的湿度，因为根据它可以确定水汽压",
        "和相对湿度. 事实上，如果露点是已知的，则水汽压 $p_1$ 也是",
        "已知的，利用不同温度的饱和水汽压表，可以求得它. 利用",
        "表也可以确定相当于温度 $t_1$ 时的饱和水汽压 $p_0$. 知道 $p_1$ 和",
        "$p_0$，则可求得相对湿度 $\\gamma=\\frac{p_1}{p_0}\\cdot100\\%$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**湿度计**　利用特殊的仪器——湿度计和干湿泡湿度计可",
        "以测定空气的湿度."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
